### ===========================================================================
### Hospital Emergency & Patient Priority Management System - API Tests
### Base URL: http://127.0.0.1:8000
### ===========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### PATIENTS ENDPOINTS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2. Register Patient 1 (Critical - Priority 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bruce Wayne",
  "age": 42,
  "gender": "Male",
  "contact": "+1-555-9999",
  "complaint": "Severe acute chest pain and diaphoresis",
  "category": "Cardiac",
  "priority": 1
}

### 3. Register Patient 2 (Urgent - Priority 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Clark Kent",
  "age": 35,
  "gender": "Male",
  "contact": "+1-555-8888",
  "complaint": "Deep penetrating abdominal wound",
  "category": "Trauma",
  "priority": 2
}

### 4. Register Patient 3 (Moderate - Priority 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Diana Prince",
  "age": 29,
  "gender": "Female",
  "contact": "+1-555-7777",
  "complaint": "Distal radius wrist fracture with deformity",
  "category": "Orthopedic",
  "priority": 3
}

### 5. Register Patient 4 (Minor - Priority 4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Barry Allen",
  "age": 26,
  "gender": "Male",
  "contact": "+1-555-6666",
  "complaint": "Superficial road rash abrasion on knee",
  "category": "Minor",
  "priority": 4
}

### 6. Register Patient 5 (Critical - Priority 1, arrives later to test FIFO tie-break)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arthur Curry",
  "age": 38,
  "gender": "Male",
  "contact": "+1-555-5555",
  "complaint": "Unresponsive following water immersion",
  "category": "Critical",
  "priority": 1
}

### 7. List All Patients
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients

### 8. List Patients Filtered by Status (WAITING)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?status=WAITING

### 9. Get Single Patient by ID (e.g. ID 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/1

### 10. Update Patient Priority (Escalate Patient #3 to Priority 1)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/3/priority
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priority": 1
}

### 11. Update Patient Status with Clinical Note
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/3/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "WAITING",
  "note": "Re-triaged by head nurse: condition deteriorating."
}

### 12. Get Patient Treatment Timeline History (from Custom LinkedList)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/1/history

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### EMERGENCY QUEUE (MIN-HEAP) ENDPOINTS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 13. Get Sorted Emergency Waiting Queue (Live Min-Heap Order)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/queue

### 14. Allocate Next Highest Priority Patient to First Available Doctor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/allocate

### 15. Run Aging Boost on Waiting Patients (> 30 minutes threshold)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/apply-aging
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "threshold_minutes": 30
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### DOCTORS (FIFO QUEUE) ENDPOINTS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 16. List All Doctors & Availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors

### 17. Register a New Doctor (Enqueues to FIFO Queue)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dr. Stephen Strange",
  "specialization": "Neuro & Trauma Surgery"
}

### 18. Update Doctor Availability (Toggle off-duty)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/1/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_available": false
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### DISCHARGE & AUTO-ALLOCATION
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 19. Discharge Patient (Frees Doctor & Triggers Auto-Allocation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/1/discharge

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### KPI & OPERATIONAL REPORTS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 20. Hospital KPI Summary Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/summary


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### DSA EMPIRICAL BENCHMARK
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 21. Run Empirical DSA Benchmark (MinHeap vs Sorted List vs Linear Scan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/benchmark?sizes=1000,5000,10000
